{"page":141,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:102","surah":6,"ayah":102,"ar_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكُمُ ٱللَّهُ رَبُّكُمْ ۖ لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ ۖ خَـٰلِقُ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ فَٱعْبُدُوهُ ۚ وَهُوَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ وَكِيلٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"This is God, your Lord, there is no God but Him, the Creator of all things, so worship Him; He is in charge of everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ذَٰلِكُمُ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālikumu","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(is) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَبُّكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbukum","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَآ","en_gloss":"(there is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَـٰهَ","en_gloss":"god","transliteration":"ilāha","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هُوَ ۖ","en_gloss":"Him","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خَـٰلِقُ","en_gloss":"(the) Creator","transliteration":"khāliqu","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"(of) every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":10,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَٱعْبُدُوهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"so worship Him","transliteration":"fa-uʿ'budūhu","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"(is) on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":15,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَكِيلٌۭ","en_gloss":"a Guardian","transliteration":"wakīlun","verse_key":"6:102"},{"pos":17,"ar":"١٠٢","en_gloss":"(102)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:102"}]},{"verse_key":"6:103","surah":6,"ayah":103,"ar_uthmani":"لَّا تُدْرِكُهُ ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرُ وَهُوَ يُدْرِكُ ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرَ ۖ وَهُوَ ٱللَّطِيفُ ٱلْخَبِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"No vision can take Him in, but He takes in all vision. He is the All Subtle, the All Aware.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"Not (can)","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"6:103"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُدْرِكُهُ","en_gloss":"grasp Him","transliteration":"tud'rikuhu","verse_key":"6:103"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرُ","en_gloss":"the visions","transliteration":"l-abṣāru","verse_key":"6:103"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"but He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"6:103"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُدْرِكُ","en_gloss":"(can) grasp","transliteration":"yud'riku","verse_key":"6:103"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرَ ۖ","en_gloss":"(all) the vision","transliteration":"l-abṣāra","verse_key":"6:103"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and He (is)","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"6:103"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّطِيفُ","en_gloss":"the All-Subtle","transliteration":"l-laṭīfu","verse_key":"6:103"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْخَبِيرُ","en_gloss":"the All-Aware","transliteration":"l-khabīru","verse_key":"6:103"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٠٣","en_gloss":"(103)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:103"}]},{"verse_key":"6:104","surah":6,"ayah":104,"ar_uthmani":"قَدْ جَآءَكُم بَصَآئِرُ مِن رَّبِّكُمْ ۖ فَمَنْ أَبْصَرَ فَلِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ وَمَنْ عَمِىَ فَعَلَيْهَا ۚ وَمَآ أَنَا۠ عَلَيْكُم بِحَفِيظٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Now clear proof has come to you from your Lord: if anyone sees it, that will be to his advantage; if anyone is blind to it, that will be to his loss- [Say], ‘I am not your guardian.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Verily","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءَكُم","en_gloss":"has come to you","transliteration":"jāakum","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَصَآئِرُ","en_gloss":"enlightenment","transliteration":"baṣāiru","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَّبِّكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbikum","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَمَنْ","en_gloss":"Then whoever","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَبْصَرَ","en_gloss":"sees","transliteration":"abṣara","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَلِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"then (it is) for his soul","transliteration":"falinafsihi","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَمِىَ","en_gloss":"(is) blind","transliteration":"ʿamiya","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَعَلَيْهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"then (it is) against himself","transliteration":"faʿalayhā","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَنَا۠","en_gloss":"(am) I","transliteration":"anā","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَيْكُم","en_gloss":"over you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِحَفِيظٍۢ","en_gloss":"a guardian","transliteration":"biḥafīẓin","verse_key":"6:104"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٠٤","en_gloss":"(104)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:104"}]},{"verse_key":"6:105","surah":6,"ayah":105,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ نُصَرِّفُ ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ وَلِيَقُولُوا۟ دَرَسْتَ وَلِنُبَيِّنَهُۥ لِقَوْمٍ يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"This is how We explain Our revelations in various ways- though they will say, ‘You [Muhammad] have been studying’- to make them clear for those who know.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And thus","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"6:105"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نُصَرِّفُ","en_gloss":"We explain","transliteration":"nuṣarrifu","verse_key":"6:105"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the Signs","transliteration":"l-āyāti","verse_key":"6:105"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَلِيَقُولُوا۟","en_gloss":"that they (may) say","transliteration":"waliyaqūlū","verse_key":"6:105"},{"pos":5,"ar":"دَرَسْتَ","en_gloss":"You have studied","transliteration":"darasta","verse_key":"6:105"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلِنُبَيِّنَهُۥ","en_gloss":"and that We (may) make it clear","transliteration":"walinubayyinahu","verse_key":"6:105"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِقَوْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"for a people","transliteration":"liqawmin","verse_key":"6:105"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"who know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"6:105"},{"pos":9,"ar":"١٠٥","en_gloss":"(105)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:105"}]},{"verse_key":"6:106","surah":6,"ayah":106,"ar_uthmani":"ٱتَّبِعْ مَآ أُوحِىَ إِلَيْكَ مِن رَّبِّكَ ۖ لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ ۖ وَأَعْرِضْ عَنِ ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Follow what has been revealed to you from your Lord, there is no God but Him. Turn away from those who join other gods with Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱتَّبِعْ","en_gloss":"Follow","transliteration":"ittabiʿ","verse_key":"6:106"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:106"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أُوحِىَ","en_gloss":"has been inspired","transliteration":"ūḥiya","verse_key":"6:106"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"6:106"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:106"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَّبِّكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"6:106"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَآ","en_gloss":"(there is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"6:106"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَـٰهَ","en_gloss":"god","transliteration":"ilāha","verse_key":"6:106"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"6:106"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هُوَ ۖ","en_gloss":"Him","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"6:106"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَأَعْرِضْ","en_gloss":"and turn away","transliteration":"wa-aʿriḍ","verse_key":"6:106"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"6:106"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_gloss":"the polytheists","transliteration":"l-mush'rikīna","verse_key":"6:106"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٠٦","en_gloss":"(106)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:106"}]},{"verse_key":"6:107","surah":6,"ayah":107,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ مَآ أَشْرَكُوا۟ ۗ وَمَا جَعَلْنَـٰكَ عَلَيْهِمْ حَفِيظًا ۖ وَمَآ أَنتَ عَلَيْهِم بِوَكِيلٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If it had been God’s will, they would not have done so, but We have not made you their guardian, nor are you their keeper.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"6:107"},{"pos":2,"ar":"شَآءَ","en_gloss":"(had) willed","transliteration":"shāa","verse_key":"6:107"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"6:107"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"not (they would have)","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:107"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَشْرَكُوا۟ ۗ","en_gloss":"associated partners (with Him)","transliteration":"ashrakū","verse_key":"6:107"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"6:107"},{"pos":7,"ar":"جَعَلْنَـٰكَ","en_gloss":"We have made you","transliteration":"jaʿalnāka","verse_key":"6:107"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"over them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"6:107"},{"pos":9,"ar":"حَفِيظًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"a guardian","transliteration":"ḥafīẓan","verse_key":"6:107"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"6:107"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"anta","verse_key":"6:107"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَيْهِم","en_gloss":"(are) over them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"6:107"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِوَكِيلٍۢ","en_gloss":"a manager","transliteration":"biwakīlin","verse_key":"6:107"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٠٧","en_gloss":"(107)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:107"}]},{"verse_key":"6:108","surah":6,"ayah":108,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا تَسُبُّوا۟ ٱلَّذِينَ يَدْعُونَ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ فَيَسُبُّوا۟ ٱللَّهَ عَدْوًۢا بِغَيْرِ عِلْمٍ ۗ كَذَٰلِكَ زَيَّنَّا لِكُلِّ أُمَّةٍ عَمَلَهُمْ ثُمَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّهِم مَّرْجِعُهُمْ فَيُنَبِّئُهُم بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Believers], do not revile those they call on beside God in case they, in their hostility and ignorance, revile God. To each community We make their own actions seem alluring, but in the end they will return to their Lord and He will inform them of all they did.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَسُبُّوا۟","en_gloss":"insult","transliteration":"tasubbū","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"they invoke","transliteration":"yadʿūna","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":6,"ar":"دُونِ","en_gloss":"other than","transliteration":"dūni","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَيَسُبُّوا۟","en_gloss":"lest they insult","transliteration":"fayasubbū","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَدْوًۢا","en_gloss":"(in) enmity","transliteration":"ʿadwan","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِغَيْرِ","en_gloss":"without","transliteration":"bighayri","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عِلْمٍۢ ۗ","en_gloss":"knowledge","transliteration":"ʿil'min","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Thus","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":14,"ar":"زَيَّنَّا","en_gloss":"We have made fair-seeming","transliteration":"zayyannā","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لِكُلِّ","en_gloss":"to every","transliteration":"likulli","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أُمَّةٍ","en_gloss":"community","transliteration":"ummatin","verse_key":"6:108"},{"pos":1